# Student Grade Calculator

## Project Overview

The Student Grade Calculator is an Excel-based project used to calculate student marks, percentages, grades, and results.

## Features

* Automatic percentage calculation
* Grade calculation
* Pass/Fail status
* Conditional formatting
* Student performance chart
* Student summary dashboard

## Tools Used

* Microsoft Excel
* Excel formulas
* Charts and conditional formatting

## Objective

To simplify student grade calculation and analyze student academic performance.
